# AWS-0052: Application load balancer not set to drop invalid headers
# This finding applies only to fixture ALBs created in examples/ for Terratest runs.
# The alb-listener module manages listeners, not the ALB itself; the fixture ALB is
# ephemeral test infrastructure and not subject to production hardening requirements.
AWS-0052

# AWS-0104: Security group unrestricted egress
# Fixture security groups in examples/ allow unrestricted egress so the fixture ALB
# can reach test targets. These security groups are ephemeral and not production resources.
AWS-0104

# AWS-0178: VPC Flow Logs not enabled
# This finding applies only to example/fixture VPCs used in Terratest runs.
# Fixture VPCs are ephemeral (created and destroyed per test run) and do not require
# production-grade VPC Flow Log configuration.
AWS-0178
